@api = http://localhost:5000

### Danh sach bai tap -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments

### Chi tiet bai tap -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/1

### Bai tap khong ton tai -> 404 + ApiError
GET {{api}}/api/assignments/999

### Nop bai hop le -> 201 Created + Location
# @name createSubmission
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "DTC245200859",
  "repositoryUrl": "https://github.com/phamzduong-pixel/CNTTK23E"
}

### Doc lai luot nop vua tao -> 200
GET {{api}}/api/submissions/{{createSubmission.response.body.$.id}}

### Nop bai thieu du lieu -> 400 + ApiError
POST {{api}}/api/assignments/1/submissions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentCode": "",
  "repositoryUrl": ""
}
